    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Everything is gone. The banners are burned, the men are dead, and there's no way out of this pass. I can hear them coming up the ridge. There is no honor left in retreating, only the shame of being taken alive by those bastards. It feels like the only thing I have left to control is how this ends.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
